 "_doc": [
  "Manifest of the datasets the validation tests run on, one list per pipeline step.",
  "Fields of an entry:",
  "  name         dataset id; its reference file is tests/ground_truth/step<N>/<name>.json.",
  "               An entry with no reference file is skipped by the tests.",
  "  data_dir     directory of the scan's .npz frames, relative to the repository root.",
  "  orientation  (step2 only) the --orientation Step 2 is run with: bottom-right (default) or upper-right.",
  "  n_frames     frame count; only used to balance the CI shards (counted from data_dir if missing).",
  "  notes        free text for humans; never read by the code.",
  "  tolerances   optional per-dataset overrides of tests/validation/metrics.DEFAULT_TOLERANCES,",
  "               e.g. {\"phi_deg\": 3.0}; unknown keys are an error.",
  "To add a dataset: add its entry here, then generate and commit its reference with",
  "  python -m tests.validation.make_ground_truth --only <name>"
